OL,3,GNEWSALennon criticises 'nasty' Scottish
OL,4,ALabour as leadership bid fails
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe added: "I don't know if we have any
OL,7,Ftransgender members left in Scottish
OL,8,FLabour. They're certainly not voting
OL,9,Ffor us."
